                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f1cc7410-cc8f-3704-a88f-8d72f4f960a8",
                        "entry_id": "edaa4a17-fec3-3221-a640-ae2294cd9348",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To draw (something) along as a current does."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6281970f-011c-4b7b-a269-c74f0f87d51b",
                                "sense_id": "f1cc7410-cc8f-3704-a88f-8d72f4f960a8",
                                "text": "water entrained by steam"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0439ec7c-af64-33ea-ba52-188d9ebbe0d4",
                        "entry_id": "edaa4a17-fec3-3221-a640-ae2294cd9348",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To suspend (small particles) in the current of a fluid."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a2648aaa-db14-463d-bc22-dcf46582b05a",
                                "sense_id": "0439ec7c-af64-33ea-ba52-188d9ebbe0d4",
                                "text": "In certain cases, it is possible to entrain enough of the solids continually in the effluent gas stream and then to disentrain them again away from the bed."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "887b150e-8d47-3dfd-af8d-e46821b326c2",
                        "entry_id": "edaa4a17-fec3-3221-a640-ae2294cd9348",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To set up or propagate (a signal), such as an oscillation."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3586d9a6-9397-330d-8f47-f1af07302596",
                        "entry_id": "edaa4a17-fec3-3221-a640-ae2294cd9348",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To conjoin, to link; as in a series of entities, elements, objects or processes."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively",
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7206fc5a-e7a2-3db6-aa2b-a4c8a0e8c557",
                        "entry_id": "edaa4a17-fec3-3221-a640-ae2294cd9348",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To become trained or conditioned in (a pattern of brain behavior)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "23f0b9bf-7972-470c-8b33-81caac0d8ee8",
                                "sense_id": "7206fc5a-e7a2-3db6-aa2b-a4c8a0e8c557",
                                "text": "There are several neurofeedback-related approaches that make use of auditory and/or visual stimulation (AVS) to entrain or disentrain brain electrical activity."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "32ae06e2-9efd-48c5-903a-5a740301eb94",
                                "sense_id": "7206fc5a-e7a2-3db6-aa2b-a4c8a0e8c557",
                                "text": "Hence, interestingly, a speaker (VR) might disentrain in no-frequency but entrain in the frequency of a particular discourse function; we also have a speaker with the opposite pattern (DF)."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fc20c40c-faa0-3ed3-aee5-d5876b987c15",
                        "entry_id": "edaa4a17-fec3-3221-a640-ae2294cd9348",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To draw, induce, or bring about."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "literary",
                            "rare",
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "abea1d80-442f-4d27-902a-4990598bf229",
                                "sense_id": "fc20c40c-faa0-3ed3-aee5-d5876b987c15",
                                "text": "Thou muſt doe well, / Faith true obtaine: / Wit none repell, / Friend déere entraine."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3449095a-0d45-4300-bffd-3e6c1127d4fe",
                                "sense_id": "fc20c40c-faa0-3ed3-aee5-d5876b987c15",
                                "text": "That infancie looketh forward, and age backward; was it not that which lanus his double viſage ſignifide? yeares entraine me if they pleaſe; but backward."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "241d9b0e-2f85-4b60-8bcd-466f1830ecd5",
                                "sense_id": "fc20c40c-faa0-3ed3-aee5-d5876b987c15",
                                "text": "It is not the gawdy luſtre of the Purple, but the inward vertue of the Perſon, that proclaims Greatneſs; having alwayes obſerved you to entrain Humility and Integrity for your Retainers."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6f359128-efa5-4960-84c9-66afde5aafcd",
                                "sense_id": "fc20c40c-faa0-3ed3-aee5-d5876b987c15",
                                "text": "The Stomach (like an Aged Maid, / Shrunk up, for want of human aid) / The Common Debt of Nature paid, / And with it’s Deſtiny entrain’d their Fate."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d8410a35-4918-47b7-b474-fcec510a5d6b",
                                "sense_id": "fc20c40c-faa0-3ed3-aee5-d5876b987c15",
                                "text": "I was my own boss and I had my own hours, but unlike other bosses I entrained only my own ruin, my own bankruptcy."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "96883330-ff23-41a9-b953-7d4bb80cb347",
                                "sense_id": "fc20c40c-faa0-3ed3-aee5-d5876b987c15",
                                "text": "If the world survives, this war will surely be taught as a textbook case of a colossal military blunder entrained by deceit and self-deception."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
